      "value": "<p>At 6th level, the astrologian can search through time to recall some bit of forgotten lore or information. As a free action, she can retry any Knowledge skill check she has made within the past minute, gaining an insight bonus on the check equal to her Wisdom modifier. This ability can be used on the same knowledge check multiple times. She can use this ability a number times per day equal to her Wisdom modifier.</p>",
